WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:08.307
Pong Arena is the old paddle game, turned up a notch. A square arena, one paddle per player, and up to four of you.

2
00:00:09.007 --> 00:00:14.021
Slide your paddle with the arrow keys, or just drag along your side of the screen.

3
00:00:14.171 --> 00:00:20.367
Hit the ball with the edge of your paddle to steer it. And be careful, because it speeds up with every hit.

4
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:27.182
Every time the ball gets past you, you lose a life. At zero, your side turns into a wall.

5
00:00:27.332 --> 00:00:29.533
Last player with lives left wins.
